  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Higher Education Partnership-Morocco Award</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Higher Education Partnerships - Morocco is designed to accelerate institutional capacity development through partnerships and innovation between higher education institutions (HEIs) in the United States (U.S.) and partner countries that have a USAID presence. Specifically, to support the creation of a new and comprehensive undergraduate degree in teaching (Licence en science de lenseignement) within Moroccan universities..</narrative>
  </description>
